flowchart LR
  U[User] -->|asks| UI[Chat UI]
  UI -->|routes| Q[Query Brain]
  Q -->|uses| SEM[Semantic Layer]
  Q -->|uses| OKF[OKF SOPs]
  Q -->|SQL| DB[(DuckDB Data)]
  DB -->|results| INS[Narration + Trust]
  INS -->|answer| UI
  UI -->|shows| U

  classDef user fill:#0f766e,stroke:#5eead4,stroke-width:2px,color:#ffffff
  classDef ui fill:#1d4ed8,stroke:#93c5fd,stroke-width:2px,color:#ffffff
  classDef brain fill:#7c3aed,stroke:#c4b5fd,stroke-width:2px,color:#ffffff
  classDef data fill:#b45309,stroke:#fcd34d,stroke-width:2px,color:#ffffff
  classDef know fill:#be185d,stroke:#f9a8d4,stroke-width:2px,color:#ffffff
  classDef out fill:#047857,stroke:#6ee7b7,stroke-width:2px,color:#ffffff

  class U user
  class UI ui
  class Q,SEM brain
  class DB data
  class OKF know
  class INS out

  linkStyle default stroke:#94a3b8,stroke-width:2px
